                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This top down arena shooter is weird. On paper the formula is there, it implements all the stuff, but it looks like an asset flip and it feels like it was a dev checklist. When I tried the original, I dropped it in the very beginning. Guess it wasn't balanced for single player at all. This remastered release - not sure if it's a bug or some easy mode, but there was infinite health. Well, there are 4 \"worlds\" and a boss, an hour of content in total. Will I replay it in coop? It doesn't have the spark, so very unlikely.",
